{"id":"vod_sn_36992","vodId":"36992","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"独占我的英雄","name_cn":"独占我的英雄","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/f0535ecb07a71633951052af02a684e2.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《独占我的英雄》改编自ありいめめこ创作的同名漫画。2017年3月25日，官方宣布了动画化的决定。动画由Encourage Films制作，于2017年7月8日开始播出。因为失去，所以追求。“归宿”和“羁绊”是最重要的。我讨厌英雄。因为在自己的眼前并没有出现过。不良少年正广与有着“熊杀”之称的康介相遇了。渴望着能有哭泣的“归宿”的正广。有着温柔而又坚实臂膀的康介。在温暖中映射出了耀眼的感情。一直在一起的约定被打破，因此健介和支仓绝交了。但是，支仓却无法忘记健介。支仓想要再一次看到健介的笑容。彼此的内心互相交错，形成了“羁绊”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:47:52","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EHCrDEF7xw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nMh5MNe82C1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bPAtnKGydE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vmbrrb5sV51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zZKNVCe4gt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/twFyBxhWj71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/b95gtjpCs91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eLkwQEvZS91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AjrqU7Ntea1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RzGcE1N2hT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rB1jiCEMjg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uTJMQpiYbs1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:16.453Z"}